// Clean-room IDL for the M7/P6 Slice 5b reverse-direction Connext PUBLISHER (external
// rtiddsgen interop peer; NOT part of the clean-room Lisp stack — see docs/provenance.md).
//
// Transcribed from OUR interop type definition (src/dds-tests/secure-interop.lisp): the
// Fast DDS example @extensibility(APPENDABLE) struct HelloWorld { unsigned long index;
// string message; } on topic "HelloWorldTopic", type name "HelloWorld", NO_KEY (no @key
// member), XCDR1/PLAIN_CDR. Authored from the type definition, never copied from RTI
// source or rtiddsgen output. No @key member => rtiddsgen registers a NO_KEY DataWriter
// (RTPS 2.5 §9.3.1.2 writer kind 0x03), matching our NO_KEY reader (kind 0x04).

@appendable
struct HelloWorld {
    unsigned long index;
    string message;
};
